{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2021-11-17 07:55:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES NOVEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, NOV. 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE NOVEMBER 2021 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO WHICH PAY ON A MONTHLY BASIS AS WELL AS XIU. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON NOVEMBER 24, 2021 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON NOVEMBER 30, 2021.'}